        20
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Leesville%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "By the late 1800s, Leesville boasted a shoe maker, chair factory, and blacksmith, fueling local industry.",
